    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "****Please do not send viewing request, if you are looking as a  couple or 2x people and no working from home**** Single Profile Only!! \n\n*NO COUPLES PLEASE *\n\nThis newly built house is 4 bed, two story, semi detached type. This peaceful, lovely neighborhood is within a newly constructed housing estate.\n\nTransportation  \n- Easy access to Irish Rail, Dart, Bus within 5 mins walk.\n- Fonthill station is just the opposite, with direct access to Connolly / Heuston train stations (12 minutes Journey).\n- Bus stop for number 13, 151, G2 is just a 15 minute walk covering the city center (30-40 minute journey).\n- Bus stop for number L54 is just a 5 minute walk covering Red Cow Luas Stop.\n\nEssential Stores:\n- 15 to 20 mins walk to Lidl and other super shops.\n- Close to Fonthill Retail Business Park and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre.\n\nThis cozy, spacious Single bedroom room( long term) a big wardrobe. This room is east facing and very bright, clean, completely new built house, including all the essential living amenities like washing machine, dryer, modern kitchen, heating, oven, microwave, etc. \n\nSingle room \nYou will share the bathroom with another person just outside your room.\n \n looking for someone who shares our values of peace, quiet, and clean & tidy living environment. If you appreciate a calm atmosphere without disruptive habits, this could be the perfect place for you. You will share the house with 1 person which is working full time. \n\nAmenities:\nWifi\nAlarm\nMicrowave/Hob/Oven/Fridge\nWashing Machine/Dryer\nIron/ Iron Table\nElectric Kettle / Toaster\nAir Fryer\nFiltered Drinking Water\nSoftened Water in all tap\n24hr hot water\nVacuum Cleaner\nGood Quality Bed Frame and Mattress\nBed Side Table and Lamp\nBlind and Curtains\n\nPreference: Quite, mindful, Clean and Tidy. Not working from home! NO couples or two ppl. \n\nIf you are genuinely interested, please  call me or WhatsApp with a brief description of yourself, including the basic details, duration of your intended start date and total stay. We will arrange a viewing soon after.\n\nThis is for long term  rental ( single bedroom room ) preferably professional with a full time job that is not working from home. \nChirag \n0838836127"
      }
    ],
